  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v2.2.1 - SpawnDev.SpawnJS 3.0.1. Firefox: a \"background.scripts\" background now runs as the BACKGROUND. GetExtensionMode recognized a Firefox background only by a page named background.html, but Firefox runs a scripts-based background in the page it generates (_generated_background_page.html), so it was taken for an extension page and its background services (runtime listeners such as onInstalled / onMessage) never started. An app that references SpawnDev.SpawnJS 3.0.0 directly gets NU1605 (downgrade): move it to 3.0.1.",
